  "summary": "Claudraband is a documented CLI/daemon/library wrapper that runs the official Claude Code TUI inside controlled tmux (or experimental xterm) terminals, exposing resumable sessions via CLI commands, an HTTP daemon API with SSE streaming, and an ACP server for editor frontends.",
